# Authority Asset Creation — environment variables
# Only the variables this skill actually needs (see README + files/04-automation-spec.md).
# Manual-first skill (Automation 2/5): documenting real work is human; no API keys required.
# The proof-density count runs locally (regex). Generating the optional Hormozi "foil" draft
# would use ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, but it is not required to produce or score the asset.

PROJECT_ROOT=          # absolute path to the project root on this machine
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=   # optional — only to auto-generate the generic AI "foil" for comparison
